	(text "System-5 bus driver card, Rev C (BUSDRV-C, 2026): BUSDRV-B on all 36 positions of the bus Rev D (docs/manual/bus.md, the 36-pin extension). Design notes: ../DESIGN.md." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2862648-3fa5-54d5-9d63-fca15afd4ff6"))
	(text "U1 (0x20) and U2 (0x21) as on BUSDRV-B; U3 (0x22): -EF1..-EF3, -PAUSE, -DMAIN (open collector: pulled low or let float), SC0 (read only), the DEBUG cable's CLOCK, SC0, SC1, spares." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1f444eb5-5971-5d8a-b9e3-b1dffc3f850b"))
	(text "CLK OUT: the Nano's Timer 1 (D9) through R7, on J2 and the DEBUG header J4, cabled to CPU Rev D's J2 (EXT CLK): LOAD mode by the clock (option B). Probes on D8 and A1 through 1k." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6b14bfda-b029-542b-aaa8-ac321c363a8e"))
	(text "The Nano runs from its USB; the expanders and pull-ups from bus +5V, sensed on A0 (R4/R5); D4 holds the expanders in reset until the bus is up." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d360c947-00d3-5e55-82d6-a6e71328be7b"))
	(text "Generated by gen/make_schematic.py from gen/netlist.py." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.40 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "980a63ed-6a40-5690-8f82-d3bffd07f99d"))
